msgstr "Authorization window, days"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_hold_days_desc"
msgid "How long the issuer keeps the funds blocked (Hyp: about 5 days). Used to show the capture deadline on the order page."
msgstr "How long the issuer keeps the funds blocked (Hyp: about 5 days). Used to show the capture deadline on the order page."

