msgstr "Hyp did not return a readable answer to the capture request. The hold is left locked: check the transaction in the Hyp control panel before trying again."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_stuck_capturing"
msgid "A capture was sent but the answer never arrived. Check the transaction in the Hyp control panel: if it was charged, no further action is needed; if it was not, the hold can be released from here after the state is corrected in the database."
msgstr "A capture was sent but the answer never arrived. Check the transaction in the Hyp control panel: if it was charged, no further action is needed; if it was not, the hold can be released from here after the state is corrected in the database."

